  "body": "Synapse is currently failing to pass all of the tests in [Complement](https://github.com/matrix-org/complement/). Fixing this would be a requirement to removing the \"soft-fail\" attribute for running it in CI.\r\n\r\nAs of now, the tests Synapse is failing are:\r\n\r\n- [x] TestRegistration/parallel/POST_/register_returns_the_same_device_id_as_that_in_the_request\r\n- [x] TestRegistration/parallel/POST_/register_can_create_a_user\r\n- [x] TestRegistration/parallel/POST_/register_downcases_capitals_in_usernames\r\n- [x] TestOutboundFederationProfile\r\n- [x] TestOutboundFederationIgnoresMissingEventWithBadJSONForRoomVersion6\r\n- [x] TestJoinViaRoomIDAndServerName\r\n- [x] TestOutboundFederationSend\r\n- [x] TestMediaWithoutFileName/parallel/Can_upload_without_a_file_name\r\n- [x] TestMediaWithoutFileName/parallel/Can_download_without_a_file_name_locally\r\n- [x] TestMediaWithoutFileName/parallel/Can_download_without_a_file_name_over_federation\r\n- [x] TestRoomCreationReportsEventsToMyself\r\n- [x] TestKeysQueryWithDeviceIDAsObjectFails\r\n- [x] TestJoinFederatedRoomWithUnverifiableEvents\r\n\r\nAnecdotally, it's worth mentioning that all tests failed when my personal VPN was on, failing with:\r\n\r\n```\r\n2020/09/29 13:19:04 Failed to create docker network: Error response from daemon: could not find an available, non-overlapping IPv4 address pool among the defaults to assign to the network\r\n    federation_room_send_test.go:22: Deploy: Failed to construct blueprint: failed to find built images via ImageList: did they all build ok?\r\n```",
